# SPA rewrite: every path serves index.html so the client-side router can
# resolve /path, /quiz, /result, /roadmap, /checkout, /upsell-tracker,
# /upsell-coach, /success without 404s.
#
# Status 200 (not 301/302) means Netlify rewrites the response server-side
# and the browser URL stays as the user requested.
#
# Function endpoints (/.netlify/functions/*) and static assets are matched
# before this rule, so this catch-all doesn't shadow them.

/*    /index.html   200
